{"title":"2005 AIME II Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A game uses a deck of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> different cards, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is an integer and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/3/9e379c6fee7b1248e81a4e5882f92066a79517aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\geq 6.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"47\" height=\"15\" /> The number of possible sets of 6 cards that can be drawn from the deck is 6 times the number of possible sets of 3 cards that can be drawn. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/9/bd923e41635af40a1abe58f230732f2280b0723a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/IRyWOZQMTV8?t=150\">https://youtu.be/IRyWOZQMTV8?t=150</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of ways to draw six cards from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is given by the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Binomial_coefficient\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Binomial coefficient\">binomial coefficient</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/9/2b9f1bdf9601f96274eb464f8ae40d1837bd57a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${n \\choose 6} = \\frac{n\\cdot(n-1)\\cdot(n-2)\\cdot(n-3)\\cdot(n-4)\\cdot(n-5)}{6\\cdot5\\cdot4\\cdot3\\cdot2\\cdot1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"424\" height=\"53\" />.  \n</p><p>The number of ways to choose three cards from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/6/d56b22283d0efe0a5cf83a709cf18d235150ceee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${n\\choose 3} = \\frac{n\\cdot(n-1)\\cdot(n-2)}{3\\cdot2\\cdot1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"215\" height=\"53\" />.\n</p><p>We are given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/0/3b0e559b0da6b53a2551259d8eaa233b3332ad2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${n\\choose 6} = 6 {n \\choose 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"107\" height=\"53\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/1/04172181b9ad65adfa8eb81d0039d0a5cd1e61d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n\\cdot(n-1)\\cdot(n-2)\\cdot(n-3)\\cdot(n-4)\\cdot(n-5)}{6\\cdot5\\cdot4\\cdot3\\cdot2\\cdot1} = 6 \\frac{n\\cdot(n-1)\\cdot(n-2)}{3\\cdot2\\cdot1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"547\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p><p>Cancelling like terms, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/7/df71bde585c31468608ae0bcb08772ce83515673.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n - 3)(n - 4)(n - 5) = 720$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"220\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>We must find a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Factoring\" title=\"Factoring\">factorization</a> of the left-hand side of this equation into three consecutive <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">integers</a>. Since 720 is close to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/8/858337ce967a800b4ab78cb9f2226d2ad007549e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9^3=729$\" width=\"67\" height=\"15\" />, we try 8, 9, and 10, which works, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/6/6a639929a9aaaf6137d98e64b022550f02de5b0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n - 3 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"84\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/a/c4a710d7a9f633fee212b43e1a117750fbccb8d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\boxed{013}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"74\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II\" title=\"2005 AIME II\">2005 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2005 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2005\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2005 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2005 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2005 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2005 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2005 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2005 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2005 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2005 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2005 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2005 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2005 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2005 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</d